<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1865250202"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:18.000"><div begin="28.453" end="55.407" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="28.453" end="34.820" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.453" end="29.106">当时的</span><span begin="29.106" end="30.209">音乐</span><span begin="30.209" end="30.635">多热</span><span begin="30.635" end="31.542">闹</span> <span begin="31.542" end="32.318">我</span><span begin="32.318" end="33.030">们</span><span begin="33.030" end="34.063">多招</span><span begin="34.063" end="34.820">摇</span></p><p begin="35.263" end="38.817" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.263" end="35.858">说</span><span begin="35.858" end="36.074">不</span><span begin="36.074" end="36.617">完</span><span begin="36.617" end="37.414">的玩</span><span begin="37.414" end="38.817">笑</span></p><p begin="42.117" end="48.531" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.117" end="42.867">是谁把</span><span begin="42.867" end="43.465">音</span><span begin="43.465" end="44.260">乐关</span><span begin="44.260" end="45.174">掉</span> <span begin="45.174" end="46.005">只剩</span><span begin="46.005" end="46.799">下</span><span begin="46.799" end="47.747">心在</span><span begin="47.747" end="48.531">跳</span></p><p begin="48.961" end="55.407" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.961" end="49.706">有没有</span><span begin="49.706" end="50.323">被</span><span begin="50.323" end="51.192">你听</span><span begin="51.192" end="53.653">到</span> <span begin="53.975" end="54.551">鼓点乱</span><span begin="54.551" end="55.407">敲</span></p></div><div begin="55.863" end="1:21.532" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="55.863" end="1:01.374" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.863" end="56.537">是不是</span><span begin="56.537" end="57.167">时</span><span begin="57.167" end="59.759">机刚好 夜色温</span><span begin="59.759" end="1:01.374">柔</span></p><p begin="1:02.611" end="1:07.121" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.611" end="1:03.378">思念在</span><span begin="1:03.378" end="1:04.052">暗</span><span begin="1:04.052" end="1:04.884">处怂</span><span begin="1:04.884" end="1:07.121">恿</span></p><p begin="1:09.511" end="1:14.801" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.511" end="1:09.846">谁</span><span begin="1:09.846" end="1:10.344">也</span><span begin="1:10.344" end="1:13.517">阻止不了恋爱自</span><span begin="1:13.517" end="1:14.801">由</span></p><p begin="1:16.446" end="1:21.532" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.446" end="1:17.213">一无所</span><span begin="1:17.213" end="1:18.107">有</span> <span begin="1:18.158" end="1:18.791">也不贫</span><span begin="1:18.791" end="1:21.532">穷</span></p></div><div begin="1:33.514" end="2:00.692" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:33.514" end="1:40.041" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:33.514" end="1:34.288">伤口要</span><span begin="1:34.288" end="1:35.750">慢慢治</span><span begin="1:35.750" end="1:36.518">疗</span> <span begin="1:36.518" end="1:37.419">时</span><span begin="1:37.419" end="1:38.228">间</span><span begin="1:38.228" end="1:39.105">是良</span><span begin="1:39.105" end="1:40.041">药</span></p><p begin="1:40.458" end="1:44.006" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:40.458" end="1:41.136">一切都</span><span begin="1:41.136" end="1:41.717">过</span><span begin="1:41.717" end="1:42.515">期无</span><span begin="1:42.515" end="1:44.006">效</span></p><p begin="1:47.219" end="1:53.822" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:47.219" end="1:47.950">宁静的</span><span begin="1:47.950" end="1:48.601">夜</span><span begin="1:48.601" end="1:49.398">多难</span><span begin="1:49.398" end="1:50.352">熬</span> <span begin="1:50.352" end="1:51.149">回</span><span begin="1:51.149" end="1:51.922">忆</span><span begin="1:51.922" end="1:52.865">是水</span><span begin="1:52.865" end="1:53.822">草</span></p><p begin="1:54.111" end="2:00.692" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:54.111" end="1:54.845">经过了</span><span begin="1:54.845" end="1:55.454">依</span><span begin="1:55.454" end="1:56.286">然缠</span><span begin="1:56.286" end="1:58.260">绕</span> <span begin="1:59.211" end="1:59.794">缠</span><span begin="1:59.794" end="2:00.692">绕</span></p></div><div begin="2:00.969" end="2:25.876" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="2:00.969" end="2:06.133" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:00.969" end="2:01.702">是不是</span><span begin="2:01.702" end="2:02.293">不</span><span begin="2:02.293" end="2:04.855">该计较 谁对谁</span><span begin="2:04.855" end="2:06.133">错</span></p><p begin="2:07.763" end="2:12.591" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:07.763" end="2:08.567">是爱先</span><span begin="2:08.567" end="2:09.190">落</span><span begin="2:09.190" end="2:10.066">荒而</span><span begin="2:10.066" end="2:12.591">逃</span></p><p begin="2:14.668" end="2:19.827" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:14.668" end="2:15.029">曾</span><span begin="2:15.029" end="2:15.527">经</span><span begin="2:15.527" end="2:18.599">爱你多少 都不重</span><span begin="2:18.599" end="2:19.827">要</span></p><p begin="2:21.561" end="2:25.876" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:21.561" end="2:22.368">留着回</span><span begin="2:22.368" end="2:23.193">忆</span> <span begin="2:23.298" end="2:24.065">与我偕</span><span begin="2:24.065" end="2:25.876">老</span></p></div><div begin="2:26.714" end="2:50.519" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="2:26.714" end="2:29.666" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:26.714" end="2:27.602">如果当时</span><span begin="2:27.602" end="2:28.276">紧紧</span><span begin="2:28.276" end="2:28.867">拥</span><span begin="2:28.867" end="2:29.666">抱</span></p><p begin="2:29.912" end="2:36.306" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:29.912" end="2:30.403">是不</span><span begin="2:30.403" end="2:30.795">是</span><span begin="2:30.795" end="2:31.504">结</span><span begin="2:31.504" end="2:31.956">局</span><span begin="2:31.956" end="2:32.556">就不会</span><span begin="2:32.556" end="2:33.582">这么</span><span begin="2:33.582" end="2:34.028">潦</span><sp